  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Laguna de Bay Institutional Strengthening and Community Participation/LISCOP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching objective of the proposed project is to assist the Laguna Lake Development Authority (LLDA), Local Government Units(LGUs) and other stakeholders to improve the environmental quality of the Laguna De Bay watershed.This will be achieved through: (i) behavioral changes and activities undertaken by watershed users to improve the environmental quality o f the lake and its watershed; and, (ii) improved planning, regulatory instruments and incentives, and participation in the environmental management o f the Laguna de Bay watershed.</narrative>
  </description>
